  "problem": "Let\n$E=[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 2 \\\\ 4 & 0 \\\\ 3 & 5 \\\\ 7 & -6\\end{aligned}]$\nand\n$F=[\\begin{aligned}9 & -2 & 8 & 1 \\\\ -4 & 6 & 0 & -3\\end{aligned}].$\nThen, the dimensions of $FE$ are{{field-1}}$\\times $\n{{field-2}}.",
